    "Data structures and interfaces": "classDiagram\n    class Main {\n        +main(String[] args)\n    }\n    class Direction {\n        <<enum>>\n        LEFT\n        RIGHT\n        UP\n        DOWN\n    }\n    class MoveResult {\n        -boolean changed\n        -int scoreGained\n        +MoveResult(boolean changed, int scoreGained)\n        +changed() boolean\n        +scoreGained() int\n    }\n    class Spawn {\n        -int row\n        -int col\n        -int value\n        +Spawn(int row, int col, int value)\n        +row() int\n        +col() int\n        +value() int\n    }\n    class Spawner {\n        +nextSpawn() Spawn\n    }\n    class SequenceSpawner {\n        -java.util.List~Spawn~ sequence\n        -int index\n        +SequenceSpawner(java.util.List~Spawn~ seq)\n        +nextSpawn() Spawn\n        +static defaultSequence() SequenceSpawner\n    }\n    class GameStatus {\n        <<enum>>\n        IN_PROGRESS\n        WON\n        LOST\n    }\n    class Board {\n        -int[][] grid\n        +Board()\n        +clear() void\n        +getGridCopy() int[][]\n        +setCell(int row, int col, int value) void\n        +move(Direction dir) MoveResult\n        +hasTileAtLeast(int value) boolean\n        +hasAnyMoves() boolean\n    }\n    class Game {\n        -Board board\n        -Spawner spawner\n        -int score\n        -GameStatus status\n        +Game(Board board, Spawner spawner)\n        +reset() void\n        +move(Direction dir) MoveResult\n        +getScore() int\n        +getStatus() GameStatus\n        +getGridCopy() int[][]\n    }\n    Main --> Game\n    Game --> Board\n    Game --> Spawner\n    Spawner <|.. SequenceSpawner\n    Board --> MoveResult\n    Board --> Direction\n    Game --> GameStatus\n    SequenceSpawner --> Spawn\n    Game --> Spawn",
    "Program call flow": "sequenceDiagram\n    participant M as Main\n    participant G as Game\n    participant S as SequenceSpawner\n    participant B as Board\n    M->>S: defaultSequence()\n    M->>B: new Board()\n    M->>G: new Game(B, S)\n    M->>G: reset()\n    G->>B: clear()\n    G->>S: nextSpawn()\n    S-->>G: Spawn(r,c,val)\n    G->>B: setCell(r,c,val)\n    G->>S: nextSpawn()\n    S-->>G: Spawn(r2,c2,val2)\n    G->>B: setCell(r2,c2,val2)\n    M->>G: move(Direction.LEFT)\n    G->>B: move(LEFT)\n    B-->>G: MoveResult(changed, scoreGained)\n    alt changed==true\n        G->>S: nextSpawn()\n        S-->>G: Spawn(sr,sc,sv)\n        G->>B: setCell(sr,sc,sv)\n    end\n    G->>G: updateStatus(WON/LOST/IN_PROGRESS)\n    M-->>M: print grid, score, status\n    M-->>M: exit",
